{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for short intense (up to 2 minutes) matches? Hell of a Bullet is a multiplayer (both cooperative and competitive) bullet hell wave shooter without the typical slowdown on start!\u00a0Gain points by dodging bullets, catching power ups, shooting and killing enemies. Lose points by killing your friends! Can you finish all the arenas while scoring better than your friends? What strategies will you use? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell of a Bullet may be a fun party game to enjoy with your friends in short bursts, but it can also be an intense ranked wave shooter where you keep asking for &quot;one more run&quot; to improve your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.poster.avif?t=1762882660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.webm?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.mp4?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you dodge all the bullets in this coopetitive wave shooter? In Hell of a Bullet [Hell] you and up to 3 friends will face enemies with unique (and strange) patterns in arenas that affect your whole game strategy. Can you finish all the arenas while scoring more than your friends?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Coopetitive game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/b83a811fae2fa63b9ab89dc25d5519bb.avif?t=1762882660\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras_big/b83a811fae2fa63b9ab89dc25d5519bb.avif?t=1762882660 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way,\u00a0 did I mention there's a penalty for hitting the other players? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective is to survive long enough to finish the arenas, but you also want to score  better (win more!) than your friends. Don't tell anyone I said that, but I heard there're tons of strategies like throwing yourself in front of their shot, so they can get a penalty or killing them on purpose so they can't score anymore. Who would do such things? Not you, right?!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool Spacial Arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.poster.avif?t=1762882660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.webm?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.mp4?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cool special arenas with crazy effects that will most likely make you rethink your strategy! Those include: Slowdown (supernova), Teleport (wormhole) and Meteorites with more to come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy different enemy patterns</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.poster.avif?t=1762882660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.webm?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.mp4?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of seeing the same bullet patterns over and over again?!  <br>No? <br>...<br>But do you want to to see some different cool ones we made? They are cool, I swear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to this Hell of A bullet Hell!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version of the game includes:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different arenas with 3 different mechanics (teleportation, slowdown and meteor madness).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique music tracks per each arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different enemies with unique patterns and behaviors.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards so you can compete for a high score with the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (up to 4 people).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for some extra challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017480?t=1762882660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017480?t=1762882660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/f3d1b637770925db7c7d28b6938325b197bbeffa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762882660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/f3d1b637770925db7c7d28b6938325b197bbeffa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762882660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for short intense (up to 2 minutes) matches? Hell of a Bullet is a multiplayer (both cooperative and competitive) bullet hell wave shooter without the typical slowdown on start!\u00a0Gain points by dodging bullets, catching power ups, shooting and killing enemies. Lose points by killing your friends! Can you finish all the arenas while scoring better than your friends? What strategies will you use? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell of a Bullet may be a fun party game to enjoy with your friends in short bursts, but it can also be an intense ranked wave shooter where you keep asking for &quot;one more run&quot; to improve your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.poster.avif?t=1762882660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.webm?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/ac579d5760e587be6df9d9207e711b4f.mp4?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >