\" >Enjoy cool special arenas with crazy effects that will most likely make you rethink your strategy! Those include: Slowdown (supernova), Teleport (wormhole) and Meteorites with more to come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy different enemy patterns</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.poster.avif?t=1762882660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.webm?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.mp4?t=1762882660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of seeing the same bullet patterns over and over again?!  <br>No? <br>...<br>But do you want to to see some different cool ones we made? They are cool, I swear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to this Hell of A bullet Hell!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version of the game includes:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different arenas with 3 different mechanics (teleportation, slowdown and meteor madness).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique music tracks per each arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different enemies with unique patterns and behaviors.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards so you can compete for a high score with the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (up to 4 people).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for some extra challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Headless Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descript