am/apps/4017480/145415288bf7525481de9ed8c5fc03f7b8c75b03/ss_145415288bf7525481de9ed8c5fc03f7b8c75b03.600x338.jpg?t=1762882660"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/d817956c61d843b8de444e81b05391d904f05ef1/ss_d817956c61d843b8de444e81b05391d904f05ef1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762882660","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/d817956c61d843b8de444e81b05391d904f05ef1/ss_d817956c61d843b8de444e81b05391d904f05ef1.600x338.jpg?t=1762882660"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/1c665e2acb47708340a63482c16f4bb0825e4c76/ss_1c665e2acb47708340a63482c16f4bb0825e4c76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762882660","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/1c665e2acb47708340a63482c16f4bb0825e4c76/ss_1c665e2acb47708340a63482c16f4bb0825e4c76.600x338.jpg?t=1762882660"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/516068b73d4349d8be3337cbd363e33c79500d90/ss_516068b73d4349d8be3337cbd363e33c79500d90.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762882660","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/516068b73d4349d8be3337cbd363e33c79500d90/ss_516068b73d4349d8be3337cbd363e33c79500d90.600x338.jpg?t=1762882660"}],"short_description":"Can you dodge all the bullets in this coopetitive wave shooter? In Hell of a Bullet [Hell] you and up to 3 friends will face enemies with unique (and strange) patterns in arenas that change your whole strategy. Can you finish the arenas while scoring more than your friends?\u00a0","steam_appid":4017480,"support_info":{"email":"headlessgamestudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}